A '''Coralot''' is a [[Critter]] that can be found on the {{Zone|Moonglade Marsh}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Coralots''' spawn in water in the {{zone|Murkwater Loch}}, {{zone|Moonglade's Edge}}, {{zone|Westbound Wetlands}}, {{zone|North Wetlands}} and {{zone|South Wetlands}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Coralots''' swim around before standing still. If a player approaches a '''Coralot''', a red warning sign {{Mctxt|c|/!\|bold=true}} appears above its head. After {{Green|5}} seconds of the player standing still, the warning sign turns yellow {{Mctxt|e|/!\|bold=true}}. After another {{Green|3}} seconds, the warning sign disappears and the '''Coralot''' can be caught with a [[Fishing Net]] or a [[Lasso]], dropping a {{Item|Coralot Shard}}. Attempting to catch the '''Coralot''' while the warning sign is active causes it to disappear and not award its [[Attribute Shard]].

